From: Emmanuel Gil Peyrot <linkmauve@linkmauve.fr>
Date: Wed, 31 Jul 2024 18:44:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: add baseline JPEG decoding

Add baseline JPEG decoding through the V4L2 mem2mem interface.
Port the July 2024 series to current Cedrus formats and buffer handling.
Enable JPEG for the separate H616 variant.
Reject unsupported headers before programming the decoder.
Limit secondary-output changes and request exceptions to JPEG.

Link: https://patchwork.linuxtv.org/project/linux-media/cover/20240731164422.206503-1-linkmauve@linkmauve.fr/
Link: https://linkmauve.fr/dev/linux/cedrus-jpeg/v1/
Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Gil Peyrot <linkmauve@linkmauve.fr>
Co-developed-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
